# Fix Database Schema & Complete Mobile App — Final Plan

## Context
The GSO-ISUFST mobile app companion to the web dashboard has critical DB bugs (`PGRST201` ambiguous FK), incomplete screens (stubs), no travel module, no `driver` role, and broken seed data. This plan brings it to full feature parity with 7 roles.

